# The bundled Ioskeley Mono Nerd Font ships as real bytes in git, NOT in LFS:
# metor-panel embeds it via include_bytes! and must build for consumers who
# fetch the crate without LFS hydration. Override the workspace-root rule
# (`*.ttf filter=lfs …`) for these files only.
IoskeleyMonoNerdFont-*.ttf !filter !diff !merge -text
